%SIXMD 1
# @?DSHCOMP - PRIVATE DSH COMPLETION HELPER

## DESCRIPTION

DSHCOMP IS THE PRIVATE /SYSTEM/LIBEXEC/DSHCOMP HELPER USED BY DSH.
IT IS NOT A PUBLIC INTERACTIVE COMMAND.  ITS ARGUMENTS ARE SIXBIT
RECORDS PASSED BY DSH; COMPLETION OUTPUT IS WRITTEN TO STANDARD OUTPUT.

USAGE IS 'DSHCOMP MODE PREFIX'.  MODE IS A SINGLE CHARACTER:

## @?OPERANDS

### @?C - COMMAND COMPLETION
EMIT THE LONGEST COMMON MATCHING COMMAND PREFIX FROM
/SYSTEM/MANUAL/COMMANDS.

### @?A - ALL MATCHING COMMANDS
PRINT ALL COMMANDS MATCHING THE PREFIX, ONE PER LINE.

### @?P - PATH COMPLETION
EMIT THE LONGEST COMMON MATCHING PATH PREFIX IN THE SELECTED DIRECTORY.

### @?L - LIST MATCHING PATHS
PRINT MATCHING PATHS, ONE PER LINE.  DIRECTORY NAMES HAVE A TRAILING '/'.

## @?FILES

### @?/SYSTEM/MANUAL/COMMANDS
COMMAND NAME INDEX USED FOR COMMAND COMPLETION.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - MATCH FOUND AND OUTPUT PRODUCED
### @?1 - NO MATCH OR INPUT/OUTPUT FAILURE
### @?2 - INVALID ARGUMENTS OR MODE

## @?SEE ALSO

### @?DSH
